{"id":"34474177","title":"纪念孙中山先生，华农人有自己的故事！","published_at":"2026-11-12T15:58:00+08:00","published_label":"2026-11-12","cover":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckA9PB4PLrSaKB9NxtayTPneGiaWTG44gQtiblrOz4YS2ibvIr3SpL5yRpoT3o03pmZttKPb9dIVlHib8EqfQk7rwbFYeW0k9W2tDtw/0?wx_fmt=jpeg","summary":"11月12日 是伟大的民族英雄、伟大的爱国主义者 中国民主革命的伟大先驱 孙中山先生 诞辰160周年纪念日 不知你是否留意 在华农红满堂南面 坐落着一座孙中山先","tags":["人物"],"source":"wechat","original_url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/ku-1iu-HXgevuPhwsq1Orw","paper_url":"https://m.thepaper.cn/newsDetail_forward_34474177","word_count":1963,"fetched_at":"2026-11-14T07:44:17+08:00","content_html":"<div><section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/appmsgalbum?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;action=getalbum&amp;album_id=3775337430061121543&amp;scene=126&amp;sessionid=#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckDKxJszlIYxogchVvXiba7w91vydWTKcCM6vN3PXxhbpG5ZmHMv5DeboeurKbMajo1boOxO1u1IOh8NDQnr3Mibw4k372ejmYibxY/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></span></a></section></section><section><span>11月12日</span></section><section><span>是伟大的民族英雄、伟大的爱国主义者</span></section><section><span>中国民主革命的伟大先驱</span></section><section><span>孙中山先生</span></section><section><span>诞辰160周年纪念日</span></section><section><span>不知你是否留意</span></section><section><span>在华农红满堂南面</span></section><section><span>坐落着一座孙中山先生的铜像</span></section><section><span>气宇轩昂，栩栩如生</span></section><section><span>与农林讲习所门楼两两相望</span></section><section><span>栉风沐雨百余载</span></section><section><span>华农和孙中山先生之间</span></section><section><span>有着怎样的渊源？</span></section><section><span>今天，以铜像为起点</span></section><section><span>带你走进这段校史故事</span></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckAJibTyZgQ5GQB4GT4163VawgooXYdgL7T9pzPxyEeqP8IQybozQtQ9HamqP4pibXrgnhMPCZw3x4HjekCCXrliavyBBiaCoLnibu78/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckCFJ0Sn4kFSa85HhcxAp2dfD92iawiceAjcrXqH4AH2Ezjiaicvue1J8XC0TyEicOYT6KXUcXNhY9w9bdeombgiatrWbKfyteqN9v7XA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckAgBqfOaoTTEIKXfdqL5u90NNianVqLghmwFGpsk9laJVBMt176dN3XHNRv9TamUEpLopyKkZo1fMvkWibcIE0yCzeY0294Vnghk/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>百年缘起，风云故事</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><span>红满堂前的孙中山铜像，已经在华农日夜伫立了10年。无论春夏秋冬，先生总是手捧书卷，默默注视着师生来往。</span></section><section><span>这座铜像，于2016年7月2日揭幕，由孙中山的孙女孙穗芳博士捐赠。孙穗芳说，希望以这种方式传承和弘扬孙中山的不朽思想。</span></section><section><span>2024年，值华农办学115周年之际，农林讲习所门楼在洪泽湖畔复建。从此，这座铜像便与农林讲习所门楼两两相望，无言之中却似乎总有道不尽的故事，也成了华农校园的经典“打卡点”。</span><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckAE6jCuzDEks2Sibdy52wGsNsQwMjw8zktpPkzO6iaCWbUP4kyf7N1PyvWcY4wiaEup0fZyYv9VxCkpjl3gbPPhsnFnM5PnMiaY6IQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section><section><p><span><span>孙中山铜像与农林讲习所门楼两两相望</span></span></p></section></section><section><p><span>1909年，广东全省农事试验场及附设农业讲习所成立，奠定了华南农业大学的百年基业；</span></p><p><span>1952年全国高校院系调整，由中山大学农学院、岭南大学农学院和广西大学农学院畜牧兽医系及病虫害系的一部分合并成立华南农学院；</span></p><p><span>1984年，华南农学院更名为华南农业大学。</span></p><p><span>……</span></p><p><span>这段校史，许多华农人都已耳熟能详。而很多人不知道的是，孙中山与华农的渊源，可以追溯到114年前。</span></p></section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckCbXdFkphQNlAog5nNhRG417Kt7K3BayTVJfxIzDciceYPNZZxqIsqcy9d5dQsgMwibxWAF7gFbB2F4FZUCjibaJa9iccaNhPHQ1pk/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section><section><p><span><span>1912年，孙中山莅临岭南大学参观，向师生作演讲，并与教职工合影</span></span></p></section></section><p><span>1912年，孙中山莅临岭南大学参观，并向师生们做了“非学问无以建设”的演讲。1923年，孙中山再度莅临岭南大学，在怀士堂发表了“学生要立志做大事不要立志做大官”的讲话。他在岭南大学发表演说、宣传革命，大大激励了岭大师生的读书热情和积极性，也和师生们结下了深厚的情谊。</span></p><p><span>1924年，在国共两党首度携手合作、国民革命风起云涌之际，孙中山高瞻远瞩，视“教育为神圣事业，人才为立国大本”，在广州亲手创办了一文一武两所学堂——国立广东大学和黄埔军校。</span></p><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckChgibYteflIE7kM4lvdiaibxLnSxy9Xlu0CiaqClPlicHib4PJ4dDeVy6janNXLn3HNN1GZzy8VthmA27d33ESQoIicYx6KyP2ASzcrA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span>广东公立农业专门学校改组为国立广东大学农科学院</span></p></section></section><span>国立广东大学是由国</span><span>立广东高等师范学校、广东公立法科大学、广东公立农业专门学校合并组成，其中，广东公立农业专门学校改组为国立广东大学农科学院。1926年，孙中山先生逝世的第二年，为纪念这位伟大先驱，国立广东大学更名为国立中山大学。</span></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>古建留韵，薪火相承</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>无论历史演变过程中，各院系如何调整</span></p><p><span>孙中山先生“教育为立国之本”“兴学养才”</span></p><p><span>的办学理念得以延续</span></p><p><span>与此同时</span></p><p><span>独具特色的历史建筑也得以保存</span></p><p><span>据统计</span></p><p><span>华农校园有近20处历史建筑</span></p><p><span>是中山大学时期所留</span></p><p><span>不少目前仍作为办公楼、展览馆等使用</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckBibVVFkGibWPDz8sKmfzwCRDVnH9Ml5y7aN7AAFvlK9ibc9qiaFZeP4BOLg1bpKia2WTbIn3mmb1j6aXxPShnBvES69eUADkIRp1dw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><span><span>2、3号楼航拍，原中山大学农学院农林化学馆，现为人工智能与低空技术学院；</span></span><span><span>原中山大学农学院农学馆，现为湾区设计与艺术学院办公场所</span></span></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckCob0O5xzahO4a3rB2cwSVHbppV1ib5xicTnRy0xEgdZy1tVLvSvmdbc12mqy3EIReWibEwA8qguOicELiaPnwoHOc4h9GmSed1E1po/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section><section><p><span><span>4号楼，原中山大学理学院数学天文物理教室，现为马克思主义学院</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckCs2rzrxbWwcrTIWCt0VY9P18zf1H0qIBlWFJ2sDb5c4ezwqer5bP5FtctwHZc3l1wCgbAYvLbehYp2o6YCNJNlmBaZZoThYEk/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>5号楼，原中山大学理学院生物地质地理教室</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckCOvibpibqS3K1tVdVDiaFFQIfA4dAFiaIicTceCHRLONuicb2OeVwrOUIIztvKwxdWFy2gvgm42Nca8lLy3QTlOaJJUIFxOrO7MyECE/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>13号楼，原</span></span><span><span>中山大学员生娱乐场，现为对外联络处（校友会、教育发展基金会</span></span><span><span>秘书处）</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckASUg1mu0Kib38rqSKq0kUN5ib06icyI5FQxtfiaNTHdRib0fjzLQKTmNEIRNq2y34gryOP04zrdXVhp8bAChV5cvdo6q9Q4xtWbsm4/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>16号楼，原中山大学教职员宿舍，现为华南农业博物馆</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckByYv0h9joicSR5DHa51KibUibYT7icVpAGcLnPdTeEw6G91Sj7EiadjiaULh5wFIUh2lh0JWJ1iaUOicScOjF2ibE1smkyktTuRsIueo3g/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>83号楼，原中山大学乙组膳堂，现为华农酸奶文化馆</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckAgupv9AcDRTq4DfboefrL3sM9OQvgjic5fKEqRZ3T1EyefxUTL9n4OVGTOhlibDicv76lj8HcwfySHicicGj3pu5GmK8GffWH0pQw0/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>10号楼，原中山大学天文台，现为食品学院使用</span></span></p></section></section></section><p><span>钟亭、狮头喷水池等中山大学时期的经典校园景观如今也仍是华农师生放松的好去处。</span></p><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckAIibU4ia51aqI2qa9aJQccvZqblSIniaj7CJ2e7Jyd7weLmc4d4ELkYz6jdTYTq3Xk7kHsxsJvFNOh16AicHqHmHsoHryEMcjbz3o/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>钟亭</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckBGqwdmwiaXwhv3eSSVzZwU6om7lVx5oO6pHIw8Owco82CAGEBT4ClOGVXCeAOAZYyqAtGPyVj1cHQNPTbAZiadS71XmRGFe7Pno/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>狮头喷水池</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>百年松木，铭刻初心</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>在华南农业博物馆林业资源与利用展厅</span></p><p><span>有一个珍贵的展品</span></p><p><span>孙中山手植树标本——马尾松</span></p></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckDj0srJnUKs2ElkRQUOlicA5jS6kU5U6RpKM1Xeg3a6FfyBrfShMtdbm00MwmEobZUfpiaMicQ73Hl0JoebRLkibkHf8nxbicw8WhyM/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckDegLs39bnvswJ5r1j0ibVptrIpWxO2cVtfOHkS2TJUnWyhbEr9IicusdibjwjQGCzcN0SQAQJbvzssXPQsdWn5CdaYKm2dZHWob0/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckAAClEbxNMa2FwicyNdcBqLciaszm3OTDoh9bRTXhiaG77nEiaPkGPHOAh30coicNJAFPD9uF3y7BEbjOaXs8AtYGvKxQVuaylRZxfA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>华南农业博物馆展出的孙中山手植树标本</span></span></p></section></section></section><p><span>1912年，孙中山率各界人士第一次隆重举行黄花岗七十二烈士的纪念活动，并在黄花岗公园亲手栽下4棵松树，以象征烈士们坚韧不拔、英勇无畏的精神。历经百年风雨，孙中山所植的最后一棵松树于2012年百年归老。2023年，广州市黄花岗公园捐赠其中一段圆盘给华南农业博物馆，由农博馆制作成标本进行展出。</span></p><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckBdariaspgMs6BXJKuENicWS6TZczOnK5ZiaickicNQIPoHeibboMgcs4wDIsCRnmZhh2kibrgYA7OwKhFxpibMicDyZewvQLj8clZkuZibM/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section><p><span><span>孙中山亲手栽种的马尾松</span></span></p><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckAAap8FkeJqyDMib3PUib2kV7UUQsPePOPLUFCBZyRX9v8zs6ETqlxGrCH8Vc9HhzA9Kp9apSoQliaDlic9hkseqoHqGFIiaDvx4ibGY/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span>在这跨越百年的凝望中</span></p><p><span>华农人坚定前行</span></p><p><span>将历史的厚重嘱托</span></p><p><span>转化为扎根中国大地</span></p><p><span>深化“双一流</span><span>”</span><span>建设的坚实足迹</span></p><p><span>每一步</span></p><p><span>都是对先生理想最有力的回应</span></p><p><span>都是对教育兴邦最坚定的践行</span></p><p><span>此志不绝，传承不息</span></p><p><span>站在新的历史方位回望</span></p><p><span>深切缅怀孙中山先生！</span></p><p><span>更多校园历史文化故事</span></p><p><span>点击【往期回顾】了解</span></p><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckCVfMWicuBRPlClzBd8Giaz1IZ8NlSr0N61lOO1w9mk5Qn1icrPExbc24wxiaDcnkTsgOsF9A3pZhfZnfmWV2y1GwxYL1jib7yJ7BWI/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><b><span>往期回顾</span></b></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;mid=2652901626&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=2dd7e530b270a4f9328a09f16de7fc18&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckAhRcnBQJnLOWYmJz6jJOiaDFQfcDsTABHrCic6icN8WaxeN4lwtQeYXeCQ6uAx9NicclJs1AX6X8LYZNurc17qFIV51LY9EcjN2B8/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></span></a></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>/ </span></span></strong></span><span><span>能盖章的华农酸奶？华农这个大展开幕！</span></span><span><strong><span>/</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;mid=2652883044&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=db5fb4650bc043f2b01c2c7baacf5d53&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckBmw4lZAutPSnAOxRRibRH6picNjbiaUfcAPJVD0a796bY16RnKCJhHIibia2VGr8rrG022NA9BLyCSMp6g7tZpVgQlofHZjQU1IucU/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></span></a></section></section><section><section><p><span><span><strong><span>/ </span></strong></span></span><span>华农这座书库，多了一位“守望者”</span><span><strong><span>/</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;mid=2652880697&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=9774b0b6adc48122181fbe02473fb